    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "##  Sovereign AI Document Summarizer\n### Nextcloud + IONOS AI Model Hub\n\nThis workflow automates document summarization while keeping full digital sovereignty. By combining Nextcloud for file storage and the IONOS AI Model Hub, your sensitive documents stay on European infrastructure.\n\n**Requirements checklist:**\n- [ ] Nextcloud OAuth2 credentials configured (read + write)\n- [ ] IONOS Cloud API token added to credentials\n- [ ] `@ionos-cloud/n8n-nodes-ionos-cloud` node package installed\n- [ ] LangChain AI nodes enabled (`@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain`)\n- [ ] `/Notes/` folder created in your Nextcloud instance\n- [ ] Folder path set in the **List a folder** node\n\n**Data flow:**\nSchedule → List Folder → Filter → Download → Summarize → Upload Summary",
        "height": 544,
        "width": 512
      },
      "id": "7f0e174f-8c8b-4196-9311-040941ffd55a",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        368,
        240
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Process all files (update if exists)\n",
        "height": 368,
        "width": 832
      },
      "id": "0e970be6-5a11-4dbd-b60b-f83d5d3d8cfc",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1008,
        384
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Filter directories and preserve basename\nconst files = $input.all().filter(item => item.json.type !== 'directory');\nreturn files.map(item => ({\n  json: {\n    path: item.json.path,\n    basename: item.json.basename\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "preserve-filename-001",
      "name": "Preserve Filename",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1600,
        496
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Check if file exists in Qdrant, delete if yes, then insert\n",
        "height": 672,
        "width": 624
      },
      "id": "ac728383-ce00-42d0-b993-628fd53d8453",
